h3 3.2.4 Element definitions
text Each element in this specification has a definition that includes the following information:
text Categories
text A list of  to which the element belongs. These are used when defining the  for each element.
row
  link categories #content-categories
  link "content models" #content-models
text Contexts in which this element can be used
text A non-normative description of where the element can be used. This information is redundant with the content models of elements that allow this one as a child, and is provided only as a convenience.
text For simplicity, only the most specific expectations are listed. success
text "For example, all  is . Thus, elements that are  will only be listed as \"where  is expected\", since this is the more-specific expectation. Anywhere that expects  also expects , and thus also meets this expectation." success
