h3 3.2.8 Requirements relating to the bidirectional algorithm
h3 3.2.8.1 Authoring conformance criteria for bidirectional-algorithm formatting characters
text in  with  nodes in their , and text in attributes of  that allow free-form text, may contain characters in the ranges U+202A to U+202E and U+2066 to U+2069 (the bidirectional-algorithm formatting characters).
